sect1.para:
Non-Throwable object लाई &throw; गर्ने प्रयास गर्दा Error throw हुनेछ। प्रयोगकर्ता-परिभाषित classes (user classes) ले सीधै Throwable implement गर्न नसक्ने हुनाले, throw गरिने object कि त Error वा Exception को instance हुनुपर्छ, कि त तीमध्ये कुनै एकको subclass को instance हुनुपर्छ।
Non-Throwable object लाई throw गर्ने
<?php throw new class {};
&example.outputs.similar;
PHP Fatal error: Uncaught Error: Cannot throw objects that do not implement Throwable in Command line code:1 Stack trace: #0 {main}

sect1.example:
  Global scope मा Exception throw गर्ने


<?php
echo "Before exception\n";
throw new Exception('Stop execution');
echo "After exception\n";


  &example.outputs.similar;


Before exception
PHP Fatal error:  Uncaught Exception: Stop execution in Command line code:2
Stack trace:
#0 {main}
  thrown in Command line code on line 2

  Function भित्र Exception throw गर्ने


<?php

function foo() {
    echo "Before exception\n";
    throw new Exception('Stop execution');
    echo "After exception\n";
}

foo();


  &example.outputs.similar;


Before exception
PHP Fatal error:  Uncaught Exception: Stop execution in Command line code:3
Stack trace:
#0 Command line code(7): foo()
#1 {main}
  thrown in Command line code on line 3

  Expression का रूपमा throw को प्रयोग
  PHP 8.0.0 देखि मात्र अनुमति दिइएको छ।


<?php

function test() {
    do_something_risky() or throw new Exception('It did not work');
}

function do_something_risky() {
    return false; // असफलता simulate गर्ने
}

try {
    test();
} catch (Exception $e) {
    print $e->getMessage();
}


  &example.outputs;


It did not work
